  m_Name: Nagini
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 1
  m_Description: "Deep within the treacherous Laedon Undergrounds lies a creature
    of myth and terror\u2014Nagini, the Guardian of the Emerald Veins. The caves
    are home to eerie, green-glowing stones known as Vile Shards, whose malevolent
    energy warps the very air into a toxic miasma. Legends say Nagini was once an
    ordinary beast, but prolonged exposure to these shards transformed it into something
    far more monstrous and deadly. Now, it lurks in the labyrinthine caves, fiercely
    guarding the crystals as if they were its greatest treasure.\\n\\nAccording to
    the tales, Nagini\u2019s blood has become a potent, agonizing poison that ravages
    the creature from within, driving it to madness. The venom surges through its
    body like fire, inflicting unbearable pain, and legend holds that this torment
    fuels its insatiable hunger for fresh blood. It is said that Nagini seeks out
    intruders, not just to defend its lair, but to ease its suffering by draining
    their life force. Yet, no amount of blood can fully quench the torment of its
    cursed existence.\\n\\nThough many have ventured into the Laedon Undergrounds,
    seeking to uncover the truth of Nagini\u2019s nature, none have returned. Whether
    cursed by the Vile Shards or simply a victim of a cruel fate, Nagini\u2019s legend
    remains a grim warning to all who would dare seek it."
  m_DescriptionVariables: []
